B.adl=new A.a_("In short","TinyTakt does not collect personal data. There are no ads, no tracking, no analytics services, no sign-up and no accounts. Everything stays on this device.")
B.adf=new A.a_("What is stored on the device","Settings (e.g. chosen character, volume, timer length), anonymous profile nicknames, timer templates you created and \u2013 only if you use Pro and select it \u2013 your own photos as timer picture. An optional parent PIN is stored only as a salted hash in the device\u2019s protected storage. This data never leaves the device and is not uploaded to any cloud, except that the operating system may include app data in device backups (you control this in system settings).")
B.adI=new A.a_("Photos","Photos are chosen via the system photo picker. TinyTakt only receives the selected image, needs no permission for your photo library, stores a downscaled copy locally only and sends nothing to third parties. You can delete pictures any time in the parents area.")
B.adD=new A.a_("Notifications","So you notice when a timer ends even if the app is closed, the app schedules a local notification. It is generated by the operating system; no data is sent to servers. You can revoke the permission any time in system settings.")
B.adp=new A.a_("Purchases","The one-time Pro purchase is handled by the Apple App Store or Google Play. We never receive payment data. To unlock Pro the app stores only a proof (product, transaction id, time) locally. Processing by Apple/Google is governed by their privacy policies.")
B.adG=new A.a_("Apple Music (optional, iPhone/iPad only)","Parents can optionally connect Apple Music in the parents area and choose a song as timer music. iOS asks for your permission. Search and playback run through Apple (MusicKit); Apple\u2019s privacy terms apply. TinyTakt only stores song name, artist and song id as a local selection on this device and receives no listening history or account data. Children cannot search; explicit songs are filtered out. Without a connection, Apple Music stays completely off.")
B.ada=new A.a_("Children","The app is intended for children and their parents. Children cannot buy anything, open external websites or enter or share any data. Adult areas are protected by a parental gate. The parental gate does not replace legally required consent.")
B.adN=new A.a_("Your rights","Because no personal data is transmitted to us, we cannot analyse or delete data about you. Delete all local data by uninstalling the app.")
B.adm=new A.a_("Controller","[PLACEHOLDER: provider name/company]\n[PLACEHOLDER: address]\n[PLACEHOLDER: email for privacy requests]\n\nThe provider must complete these details before release.")
